# 🔟 Advanced Patterns (Production Grade)

## 🔥 1. Different Limits per API

```yaml
/users/   → 10 rps
/orders/  → 2 rps
/payments/ → 1 rps
```

---

## 🔥 2. Tier-based Limits

 Free user → 5 rps
 Premium → 50 rps

KeyResolver extracts user tier.

---

## 🔥 3. Sliding Window (Custom)

Default is token bucket.
For strict windows → custom Redis script.

---

## 🔥 4. Combine with Circuit Breaker

```Rate Limit → Retry → Circuit Breaker
```

Correct order:

```
RateLimiter → CircuitBreaker → Retry ❌
RateLimiter → Retry → CircuitBreaker ✅
```

