# 1️⃣1️⃣ Common Production Mistakes (READ THIS)

❌ In-memory rate limiting
❌ Per-pod Redis
❌ Using IP in Kubernetes (NAT issue)
❌ No burst capacity
❌ Rate limiting after auth

---

# 1️⃣2️⃣ Best Practices (Zepto-Scale)

✔ Always Redis-backed
✔ Use user-based keys (JWT / API key)
✔ Separate limits for read/write APIs
✔ Monitor Redis latency
✔ Expose rate-limit headers

---

# 1️⃣3️⃣ Rate Limiting vs Throttling vs Quotas

| Term          | Meaning           |
| ------------- | ----------------- |
| Rate limiting | Requests per time |
| Throttling    | Slow down traffic |
| Quota         | Fixed total usage |

SCG supports rate limiting, not quotas (needs custom impl).

---

# 1️⃣4️⃣ Final Summary (Straight Talk)

 Rate limiting in SCG is filter-based
 Uses Redis + Token Bucket
 KeyResolver decides who
 RedisRateLimiter decides how much
 Protects entire system before damage

